    "problems": "The experiments are described as small-scale and diagnostic rather than exhaustive. The paper says epiplexity is a preliminary metric that is not yet widely validated; it also notes that learnable information need not be useful for task completion. The detailed Experiment 1 values are shown in plots rather than transcribed, and no uncertainty estimates are reported.",
